+# ExecPlan: RT-08
+
+## Ziel
+Executable isolated photo candidate; finite local scene/lifecycle/CPU/DOM evidence and bound human-review handoff.
+## Kontext
+Base 17b1db4201a28e7b607c30707bdc2b75e3484a10. Read RT §5.2, RTF-13, registry RT08 and original package contracts. Live owner native 01a12265-edc8-71c2-b6a9-8e6b64d6937b / Paseo 3cdb1887-6156-4aec-902f-f8c474f11cb3. Six working sessions verified; custom roles serial, parent waits.
+## Nicht-Ziele
+No product integration, physics dependency migration, gameplay loop, world pause, performance qualification, GPU pilot, commit/push or publication.
+## Architekturentscheidung
+Reuse frozen GFX03 port/material data and RT01 F00 mesh fixture. Copy exact input bytes only after producer seals verify. Private snapshot data creates owned Three geometry/PBR materials. Unsupported procedural shaders/water/leaves stay explicit; never call that GFX visual parity. WebGPUPathTracer is an optional explicit runner route. DOM route never requests a GPU. Epoch guards cover asynchronous samples and PNG encoding.
+## Implementierungsphasen
+1. Verify isolation and producers, copy input closure; run RT01 historical CPU control.
+2. Verify primary npm/package pins and API; implement scene, capture lifecycle and UI.
+3. Run focused negative tests, typecheck/build and DOM diagnostics serially.
+4. Review, repair, bind exact dirty/index/dependency/build/evidence/tool bytes and deliver.
+## Tests und Evidence
+Input tamper; actual RT01 control/oracle; real Three/BVH CPU scene; fake driver unit tests explicitly MOCK for lifecycle only; actual DOM UI via DOM harness. GPU profile 32/128/512 spp retained for Runner, no local GPU use. .NET/Unity tests not applicable: no Unity/C# changes.
+## Risiken
+Upstream WebGPU APIs may drift; exact installed bytes bind the candidate. No validated pathtracer/GFX image equivalence. F00 is RD_SYNTHETIC, not product export.
+## Rollback / Safe Stop
+Only spikes/rt-08-photo/** and this spec may change. Foreign scopes fail closed. Preserve failed evidence. Missing hardware ends only hardware proof.
+## Fortschrittslog
+- Isolation and installed role registry verified; explorer finished read-only reuse inventory.
+## Definition of Done
+Executable code/tests/docs/receipt/repro; fresh finite local checks, independent review, full binding and readable diff. Hardware/adoption remain separate pending gates.
