+# Photo snapshot
+
+## ADDED Requirements
+
+### Requirement: Isolated immutable inputs
+The spike SHALL verify exact producer receipt/seal/source/index/dirty/build/dependency/fixture bindings before importing immutable owned copies. SceneSnapshot SHALL bind source, geometry, material, light, camera and frame digests and SHALL expose no active World reference. Product integration SHALL remain NO.
+
+#### Scenario: Frozen scene inspection
+- GIVEN a verified static RT-01 fixture
+- WHEN the photo scene is constructed
+- THEN all meshes come from owned copied buffers and unsupported water/foliage and shader effects are declared
+
+### Requirement: Finite photo lifecycle
+The spike SHALL use three 0.186.1, types 0.186.0 and source-verified pathtracer/BVH pins. Geometry, source, materials, light, camera and frame changes SHALL invalidate accumulation. Cancel, resize, disposal and device loss SHALL prevent stale captures. Only 32/128/512 spp profiles SHALL be offered; no simulation pause or mutation is permitted.
+
+#### Scenario: Async stale capture
+- GIVEN a pending sample or PNG encode
+- WHEN cancel, resize, replacement, loss or disposal occurs
+- THEN the obsolete result is rejected and no stale capture is adopted
+
+### Requirement: Honest evidence
+Local CPU/DOM checks SHALL be separate from real GPU convergence, cost and visual oracles. GFX-03 negative visual parity SHALL remain FAIL. Missing hardware/timers SHALL be NOT_RUN or unavailable, never numeric zero. Exact command exits and full dirty/index/lock/fixture/WASM/shader/tool/build bytebindings SHALL accompany the handoff.
+
+#### Scenario: No hardware slot
+- GIVEN no Runner/A0 slot
+- WHEN code verification completes
+- THEN executable runner profiles are delivered with GPU, convergence and art evidence NOT_RUN
