+The first tool-native `browser_run_code_unsafe` call loading `spikes/rt-08-photo/dom-repro.js` returned `isError=true`: `TypeError [ERR_VM_DYNAMIC_IMPORT_CALLBACK_MISSING]: A dynamic import callback was not specified.` No page action had run: it failed at the first `import('node:fs/promises')`. The configured VM cannot import Node filesystem modules. Fix: use tool-native screenshot paths and return JSON for own-scope recording. No package or runtime fallback was installed.
+
+The GPU runner profile originally used the same filesystem import. It must use browser-tool-native writes/returned capture bytes or the outer sole Runner's approved local write adapter. This producer never executed it.
