+# Final independent code review
+
+Installed reviewer custom role `/root/rt08_review` read-only recheck, parent waited. Result: both P2 findings fixed; no new findings in the bounded recheck. Resize UI updates after settled and has restart regression. Independent deadline/AbortSignal permits bounded cleanup; device destroy and Runner finally are wired. Capture protects provenance and checks Session/Snapshot/Epoch; Runner requires code seal and sidecars contain code bindings.
+
+Readiness: code may be delivered as LOCAL_WINDOWS_ISOLATED handoff after final seal verification. No human Plannotator, GPU output, actual compiled WGSL, convergence, art, actual hardware loss or reference acceptance was supplied. Reviewer did not execute tests/builds; real command evidence is retained separately.
+
+Own focused evidence is sufficient for the completed local implementation tasks despite inherited DevToolbox product-typecheck warning: its root config and missing product dependencies are outside RT08 scope. `completion-preflight.json` is advisory `degraded`, `hasBlockers=false`, `canProceed=true`; this is not an approval override and the failed product step remains FAIL. Hardware/owner tasks remain open. The full card stays PARTIAL.
