+# Independent reviewer, first pass and fixes
+
+Installed `reviewer` custom role `/root/rt08_review`, read-only, serial, parent waited; no recursion or model override. Verdict: fix two P2 findings before code-only handoff.
+
+1. `main.ts` synchronous resize UI update left Start disabled after complete/ready because asynchronous queue stayed busy and no active render loop updated again. Fix: production uses `resizePhoto`, immediately invalidates/updates, awaits `settled()` and updates again. Regression: completed mock capture, resize, start enabled, new accumulation.
+2. Deadline was checked only before awaited readback; an unresolved readback could hold the path indefinitely and Runner lacked finally cleanup. Fix: independent wall deadline, abortable readback wrapper, terminal owned-device interruption/cleanup and Runner finally pagehide. Regression: never-resolving mock readback, short wall deadline, one cleanup, no stale result. Actual GPU driver remains NOT_RUN.
+
+Fresh `typecheck-review-fixes`, `build-review-fixes`, `tests-review-fixes`: exits 0, 19/19 tests. Subsequent capture-provenance protection/runtime code bindings and backend/device guard: `typecheck-capture-bound`, `build-capture-bound`, `tests-capture-bound` exits 0, 20/20 tests. Protected environment/product/integrity cannot be overwritten by caller provenance. Final reviewer recheck pending separately.
+
+Seal preparation initially failed `ENOENT node_modules/@esbuild/aix-ppc64/package.json`: lock contains optional foreign-platform bins npm correctly omits on Windows. Fix only classifies entries with `optional` AND proven nonmatching `os`/`cpu`; any missing compatible dependency still fails closed. Retained as diagnostic, not package repair.
